  "bio": "Yellow Rose Tattoo Club, nestled in the heart of Kernersville, NC since 2010, specializes in vibrant traditional, neotraditional, and newschool tattoos. This creative haven, where artists like @johnbrehmtattoo, @mikeblastattoo, @erranzart_x, and @oldjermybastard wield their inks, offers a welcoming atmosphere for both ink veterans and newcomers alike. Step into their studio to experience a blend of classic artistry and modern flair that's set to leave a lasting impression.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nEst.2010\nKernersville, NC \n@johnbrehmtattoo \n@erranzart_x @piercingsbyheatherb @tyler_c_tattoo\n\nEst.2010\nKernersville, NC \n@johnbrehmtattoo \n@erranzart_x @piercingsbyheatherb @tyler_c_tattoo",
